  "$schema": "https://schemas.cerberauth.com/identity-provider/draft/2024-09/provider.schema.json",
  "name": "Scalekit",
  "abstract": "Hosted authentication for B2B SaaS and AI agents. SaaSKit covers login with passwords, magic links and one-time codes, social sign-in, sessions, organizations with roles and permissions, enterprise SSO over SAML and OIDC, SCIM directory sync, machine-to-machine tokens, and OAuth 2.1 authorization for MCP servers with Dynamic Client Registration. AgentKit gives AI agents user-scoped tool access through a vault of connected accounts. SDKs for Node.js, Python, Go and Java. The Scale plan is free up to 1 million monthly active users with one SSO connection and one SCIM directory, then charged per user, organization and extra connection.",
